"shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","review_id":"ihrCFUC975a5i1EWotQpCQ","date":"2012-06-04T17:04:27","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9439252614974976,"text_excerpt":"The food at Ralph's on The Park was good, buit its the location, the view and the atmosphere that makes this place so special. We liked it so much we decided to have our wedding reception here. Went for dinner on Friday night. We ordered the oyster appetizer which was dissapointing but they served a big hunk of french bread and whipped butter with it, so all was not lost. I ordered the BBQ shrimp at the reccomendaiton of our server. It was rich and delicious. My fiance ordered the lamb chop. He also enjoyed his. The room for or reception is just beautiful, and the private bar on the balcony really sealed the deal for me. I can't hardly wait till the big day."},{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","review_id":"uhjTWsEpfdtDi4I9fjh6sA","date":"2019-08-13T21:36:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9434871673583984,"text_excerpt":"I clicked my heels 3 times, and landed on Dumaine and St. Ann. What is so unique about this area? The oak trees, in City Park area, and the moss makes it special. The colorful houses with southern porches...ahhhh..this is what New Orleans is known for. It is definitely worth visiting. If that isn't enough inspo, check out some of our food photos below. Ralphs on the park is currently offering 3 appetizers and a glass of wine for $33.. The special runs now through September. Ralph Brennan's restaurants are ALWAYS on the top of my list. Food, drinks. service & atmosphere are highly ranked here. Thank you to our AMAZIING server! I have not visited this restaurant in years but social media me..."},{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","review_id":"6QFgAOe0LOGDFfuCDs4m7g","date":"2017-03-15T02:47:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9427457451820374,"text_excerpt":"I really loved Ralph's. We came here for a rehearsal dinner for a friend. The space is lovely. The balcony upstairs offers nice views of City Park. The staff was very good and friendly. We had a set meal. Started with some delicious gumbo. I had the red fish which was outstanding. Spicy and peppery with a not too heavy sauce. My friends found the potatoes a bit salty but I didn't notice. I also tried the shrimp dish which was excellent. We ended with a bread pudding that was a good sweet end to dinner. Really enjoyed Ralph's and would love to come back some time."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","photo_id":"nImbSWUjoLIjNGFi2ZissQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nImbSWUjoLIjNGFi2ZissQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8627519011497498},{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","photo_id":"iDE57FzGN1cVZ-jcgJe5pw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iDE57FzGN1cVZ-jcgJe5pw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8622586727142334},{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","photo_id":"grfBQhbGPzgjWAcQBel8yw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/grfBQhbGPzgjWAcQBel8yw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8319240808486938},{"business_id":"5AOkxsg6UJQ_CoJTMBDUmQ","photo_id":"a8v22XVrUMFtBeryKCvbeg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/a8v22XVrUMFtBeryKCvbeg.jpg","visual_representativ